{"unit_id":"chaserchan__dsh-plugin-global-prompt#card-zh","repo":"chaserchan/dsh-plugin-global-prompt","commit":"e6980e3e75dea4acb85bd6d771ebbd5a7a4869ee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-global-prompt 是面向 DSH Web 设置界面的全局提示词插件。它在通用设置中提供多行文本框，并把保存的内容作为系统提示词段落注入每次模型步骤，因此可统一设置回答语言、格式或其他长期要求。输入会在停止键入 600 毫秒后自动保存，并显示保存状态；清空内容则不注入。适合希望在主会话和子代理中重复使用同一提示词的用户。插件没有配置外部服务或 API 密钥的代码要求。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-49","lib/client.js:81-97","lib/client.js:158-185"]}
{"unit_id":"chaserchan__dsh-plugin-global-prompt#card-en","repo":"chaserchan/dsh-plugin-global-prompt","commit":"e6980e3e75dea4acb85bd6d771ebbd5a7a4869ee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-global-prompt adds a global prompt field to DSH Web settings. Saved text is injected into each model step as a system prompt. The multiline field autosaves after typing stops; clearing it disables the prompt. It serves users who want recurring instructions across sessions and agents.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-49","lib/client.js:81-97","lib/client.js:158-185"]}
