{"unit_id":"chaserchan__dsh-plugin-global-prompt#feature-1","repo":"chaserchan/dsh-plugin-global-prompt","commit":"e6980e3e75dea4acb85bd6d771ebbd5a7a4869ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-global-prompt 的功能「全局系统提示词」：把设置中保存的文本注册为系统提示词段落，并在每次模型步骤读取。用户在通用设置输入内容后即可让后续对话和 agent 使用该提示词。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:41-49"]}
{"unit_id":"chaserchan__dsh-plugin-global-prompt#feature-2","repo":"chaserchan/dsh-plugin-global-prompt","commit":"e6980e3e75dea4acb85bd6d771ebbd5a7a4869ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-global-prompt 的功能「自动保存设置」：在通用设置的多行文本框编辑提示词，停止输入后约 600 毫秒自动保存到设置作用域，并显示保存中、已保存或失败状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:81-97","lib/client.js:106-129","lib/client.js:174-185"]}
{"unit_id":"chaserchan__dsh-plugin-global-prompt#feature-3","repo":"chaserchan/dsh-plugin-global-prompt","commit":"e6980e3e75dea4acb85bd6d771ebbd5a7a4869ee","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-global-prompt 的功能「留空停用」：清空全局提示词后，系统提示词段落返回空文本，不再注入额外内容；输入长度最多为 20000 个字符。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:21-26","lib/index.js:44-48"]}
